      "message": "I\u0027d prefer it if this had section\u003d\u0027catalog\u0027 so that we know it\u0027s the section name.\n\nAlso, as a cleanup, there could be one function that handled both functions:\n\n SHOULD_CACHE, EXPIRATION_TIME \u003d cache.get_cache_fns(section\u003d\u0027catalog\u0027)\n\nAlternatively, could return an instance with should_cache and expiration_time members:\n\n CACHE_INFO \u003d cache.get_cache_fns(section\u003d\u0027catalog\u0027)\n\n @cache.on_arguments(should_cache_fn\u003dCACHE_INFO.should_cache, \n                                     expiration_time\u003dCACHE_INFO.expiration_time_fn)\n\nCACHE_INFO could just have the decorator:\n\n  @CACHE_INFO.on_arguments",
